      "description": "Stereo AudioScript wavefolder. osc(sine, 5-voice unison) -> asc-1 (per-sample YAMS) -> amp -> out, env -> amp.cv; Ensemble Chorus + Reverb in the FX chain. The asc-1 program folds each channel with sin(in*drive) where drive tracks velocity, one-pole LPs via state cells, and adds an internal phasor sub-octave for body.",
