  "active_instrument_id": 2,
  "song": {
    "name": "YAMS AudioScript Wavefolder",
    "author": "Pertylizer",
    "description": "Demonstrates the audio-rate AudioScript module (asc): per-sample scripted DSP. The 'Folding Reed' instrument runs one YAMS program per sample that (1) sine-wavefolds the unison oscillator with a velocity-tracked drive, (2) one-pole lowpass-filters each stereo channel via state cells, and (3) synthesizes its own sub-octave with an internal phasor — oscillator, waveshaper and filter all in one node. Harder velocity = deeper fold = brighter. None of this is reproducible with the static stock effects. Ensemble Chorus + Reverb add width and space.",
